arent!"><div class="font-mono whitespace-pre leading-6"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light-default dark-plus" style="background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#0B0C0E;color:#1f2328;--shiki-dark:#D4D4D4" language="markdown"><code language="markdown" numberOfLines="10"><span class="line"><span style="color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#D4D4D4">---</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#569CD6">name</span><span style="color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#D4D4D4">: </span><span style="color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#CE9178">security-check</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#116329;--shiki-dark:#569CD6">description</span><span style="color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#D4D4D4">: </span><span style="color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#CE9178">Run a security vulnerability scan</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#D4D4D4">---</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#D4D4D4">Analyze the codebase for security vulnerabilities including:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#6796E6">-</span><span style="color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#D4D4D4"> SQL injection risks</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#6796E6">-</span><span style="color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#D4D4D4"> XSS vulnerabilities</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#6796E6">-</span><span style="color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#D4D4D4"> Exposed credentials</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#6796E6">-</span><span style="color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#D4D4D4"> Insecure configurations</span></span>
</code></pre></div></div></div></div><div class="code-block-fade-overlay print:hidden" data-fade-overlay="true" aria-hidden="true" style="--fade-color-light:#ffffff;--fade-color-dark:#0B0C0E"></div></div>
