<span data-as="p">For which skill directories each source loads, see the <a class="link" href="/docs/en/agent-sdk/claude-code-features#control-filesystem-settings-with-settingsources">filesystem sources table</a>. For more details on <code>settingSources</code>/<code>setting_sources</code>, see the <a class="link" href="/docs/en/agent-sdk/typescript#settingsource">TypeScript SDK reference</a> or <a class="link" href="/docs/en/agent-sdk/python#settingsource">Python SDK reference</a>.</span>
<span data-as="p"><strong>Check working directory</strong>: the SDK loads skills from <code>.claude/skills/</code> in the <code>cwd</code> option and in every parent directory up to the repository root. Ensure <code>cwd</code> points at or below the directory containing <code>.claude/skills/</code>, within the same repository:</span>
<div data-orientation="horizontal" data-activation-direction="none" class="code-group p-0.5 mt-5 mb-8 flex flex-col not-prose relative rounded-2xl border border-gray-950/10 dark:border-white/10 min-w-0 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-white/5 dark:codeblock-dark text-gray-950 dark:text-gray-50 codeblock-light"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 relative pr-2.5" data-component-part="code-group-tab-bar"><div role="presentation" style="position:relative;--scroll-area-corner-height:0px;--scroll-area-corner-width:0px" data-component-part="scroll-area" class="min-w-0 flex-1 w-0 rounded-tl-xl"><div data-id="base-ui-_R_apiaqqelubqoqe9qj4npfiutb_-viewport" tabindex="-1" class="size-full rounded-[inherit] [--scroll-area-fade-size:32px] overflow-y-hidden! base-ui-disable-scrollbar" style="overflow:scroll" data-component-part="scroll-area-viewport"><div role="presentation" style="min-width:fit-content" data-component-part="scroll-area-content"><div data-orientation="horizontal" data-activation-direction="none" role="tablist" aria-label="Code examples" class="text-xs leading-6 gap-1 flex"><button type="button" data-active="" data-orientation="horizontal" data-activation-direction="none" aria-disabled="false" tabindex="-1" role="tab" aria-selected="true" id="base-ui-_R_1dapiaqqelubqoqe9qj4npfiutb_" data-composite-item-active="" class="group flex items-center relative gap-1.5 my-1 mb-1.5 outline-0 whitespace-nowrap font-medium ml-0! first:ml-2.5! focus-visible:outline-hidden text-primary dark:text-primary-light"><div class="peer/title flex items-center gap-1.5 px-1.5 rounded-lg z-10 group-focus-visible:outline-1 group-focus-visible:outline-primary dark:group-focus-visible:outline-primary-light group-hover:bg-gray-200/50 dark:group-hover:bg-gray-700/70 group-hover:text-primary dark:group-hover:text-primary-light">Python</div><div class="absolute -bottom-1.5 left-0 right-0 h-0.5 rounded-full bg-primary dark:bg-primary-light peer-empty/title:hidden"></div></button><button type="bu