<h3 class="flex whitespace-pre-wrap group font-semibold" id="additional-troubleshooting"><div class="absolute" tabindex="-1"><a href="#additional-troubleshooting" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 group/link" aria-label="Navigate to header">​<div class="size-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" stroke-width="2" class="size-3 shrink-0"><use href="#mi-mint-1-Link"></use></svg></div></a></div><span class="cursor-pointer">Additional troubleshooting</span></h3>
<span data-as="p">For general skills troubleshooting, such as YAML syntax errors and debugging, see the <a class="link" href="/docs/en/skills#troubleshooting">Claude Code skills troubleshooting section</a>.</span>
<h2 class="flex whitespace-pre-wrap group font-semibold" id="next-steps"><div class="absolute" tabindex="-1"><a href="#next-steps" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 group/link" aria-label="Navigate to header">​<div class="size-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" stroke-width="2" class="size-3 shrink-0"><use href="#mi-mint-1-Link"></use></svg></div></a></div><span class="cursor-pointer">Next steps</span></h2>
<span data-as="p">The <a class="link" href="/docs/en/skills">Claude Code skills guide</a> covers authoring in depth. Its guidance applies to SDK sessions. Start with these sections:</span>
<ul>
<li><a class="link" href="/docs/en/skills#frontmatter-reference">Frontmatter reference</a>: every supported field</li>
<li><a class="link" href="/docs/en/skills#pass-arguments-to-skills">Pass arguments to skills</a>: <code>$ARGUMENTS</code>, <code>$0</code>, and <code>$1</code>. The <a class="link" href="/docs/en/skills#available-string-substitutions">full substitution table</a> adds named arguments and the <code>${CLAUDE_*}</code> variables</li>
<li><a class="link" href="/docs/en/skills#inject-dynamic-context">Inject dynamic context</a>: <code>!`command`</code> lines that run before Claude sees the skill content</li>
<li><a class="link" href="/docs/en/skills#where-skills-live">Choose where skills load</a>: every skill location, plugin namespacing, and which skill runs when two share a name</li>
</ul>
